<title>POLAND: KETY AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>KETY AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.71 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.67 vs   2.10</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.10 vs   2.66</p>
<p> Sales		   31.03 vs  26.69</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    19.55 vs  19.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	34.43 vs  28.11</p>
<p> Operating profit    29.06 vs  29.49</p>
<p> Sales		  251.76 vs 249.34</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish aluminium plant is Zaklady</p>
<p>Metali Lekkich Kety SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
